  "description": "CR 712.11a, 715.3a, 715.2b, 715.4, 400.7, 615.1, 701.26a: Crystal Fragments, attached to a creature, exiles itself and returns transformed; Summon: Alexander enters unattached with a lore counter, its chapters I and II prevent all damage dealt to creatures its controller controls that turn, and its chapter III taps every creature its controller's opponents control before it is sacrificed",
  "note": "Turn 1: Crystal Fragments gives alice's Grizzly Bears +1/+1; after its activation the returned Saga is a new object attached to nothing, so the Bears is 2/2, and Alexander carries one lore counter. Chapter I resolves; Pyroclasm then deals no damage to alice's Bears, Savannah Lions or Alexander but 2 to bob's Hill Giant and carol's Craw Wurm, and Shock still hits alice herself. Turn 3: the shield has ended, so carol's Shock kills the Bears. Turn 4: chapter II shields again, so alice's own Shock leaves the Lions unhurt. Turn 7: chapter III taps the Giant and the Wurm, leaves alice's Lions untapped, and the Saga is sacrificed as Crystal Fragments.",
